id: pm-jira-5mxw
title: Scope preflight override to pm-jira's owned commands
description: "registerPreflight used the bare-function (global) form, which collides pairwise with every other installed package's preflight override (pm health reports extension_preflight_override_collision). Rewrite it to the scoped object form declaring exactly the mutating jira command paths isMutatingJiraInvocation recognizes (jira sync, jira import, jira export). The runtime matches a command against the commands array by exact normalized path, so the array lists full command paths, not bare top-level names (which would never match jira sync and silently disable the fail-fast). The authoritative credential gate (process.exit) stays in the override body; this only narrows its scope."
type: Issue
